From afd7cc2e4c8a0fb8f749714086a142b4b22105ee Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gabriel Fernandez <gabriel.fernandez@foss.st.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Feb 2026 11:44:05 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: st: fix power-domain labels DT coding style in
 STM32MP25

Update STM32MP25 power domain labels to comply with the Device Tree
coding style requirement. that labels use only lowercase letters,
digits and underscore.

Signed-off-by: Gabriel Fernandez <gabriel.fernandez@foss.st.com>
Change-Id: Ifb15e475e2f5ee856862a6cdb68406eaa9fe8660
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/st/linux-stm32/+/535999
Reviewed-by: Amelie DELAUNAY <amelie.delaunay@foss.st.com>
ACI: CIBUILD <MDG-smet-aci-builds@list.st.com>
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
Domain-Review: Patrick DELAUNAY <patrick.delaunay@foss.st.com>
